      "message": "Nit: `pred?` is called twice per element, once by `vector-count` and again in the loop. A 4-element vector costs 8 calls. A predicate with state, e.g. #t only the first time it sees a value, then overruns the result: \"vector-set!: index 3 is out of range\". Call it once per element and keep the answers.",
      "revId": "b8ac22d5b0a55b684657d0706c0efe31172e334b",
